- Version: 0.1.4\par
- Summary: Refined simulator navigation alignment and condensed the stacked operator layout.\par
- Notes: Made the Operational navigation button align the Operational window to the top of the scrollable content area, reduced overall UI dimensions by roughly twenty percent while keeping logger text size unchanged, adjusted fixed logger window sizing to preserve internal scrolling, and increased logger text size and general control scaling in the current stacked-window design iteration.\par
\par
\b 2026-03-10 15:26:00\b0\par
- Version: 0.1.4\par
- Summary: Refined the simulator operator UI and completed revision-control documentation for the current workflow.\par
- Notes: Added two-window simulator UI structure, widened the operational view, improved logger behavior and pause handling, updated timestamp formatting to HH:MM:SS.kk in runtime logs, documented UI color/state behavior in the detailed design, and added README workflow rules for launch order, browser cache bypass, revision-history requirements, and task-completeness checks.\par
- Resolved Defects:\par
  - UI-20260310-1: Simulator browser sessions could show stale frontend assets because the browser was opened without explicit cache bypass after backend relaunch.\par
  - UI-20260310-2: Simulator logger ordering and retention behavior did not keep newest entries at the top with bounded rolling memory.\par
\par
\b 2026-03-08\b0\par
- Version: 0.1.1\par
- Summary: Added the first functional backend simulator workflow and release-quality local tooling.\par
- Notes: Implemented FastAPI-served UI with client IP input, connect flow, brew and idle controls, live important-data cards, log console, synthetic transport state, synthetic brew telemetry, local run script, pytest API coverage, httpx test dependency, and repaired OpenXML docx generation plus detailed design content updates.\par
- Resolved Defects:\par
  - DOCX-20260308-1: Simulator requirements and detailed design docx files were corrupt because the generated OpenXML package used invalid entry names and malformed XML quoting.\par
